node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/.git
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
# Every package's dist/ too, not just the root one. The image builds its own;
# a stale host dist/ in the context would let a local build pass while CI, which
# has none, fails (or ship stale code).
**/dist
# ...and every TypeScript incremental build-info file. These are gitignored, so
# CI never has them, but on a laptop one records outputs the image does not
# have (dist/ is excluded above): `tsc --emitDeclarationOnly` then trusts it,
# emits no .d.ts, and the next package fails TS7016 (seen with worker-shared).
**/*.tsbuildinfo
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
artifacts
playwright-report
playwright-cache
docs
!docs/shared
logs
tmp
sonar-reports
supabase
infra/terraform
.github
*.log
**/*.log
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
**/.env.local
